This is a finished install of SAS/C 6.58, including a patch that fixes a Y2K bug.
This is the final and most updated version of SAS/C available.

Copy the SAS/C directory and icon file to your hard drive, then run the following
commands in the CLI so that SAS/C can run properly, or simply enter them into your
user-startup or startup-sequence to have it done automatically when you boot up. The
first line needs to be changed to point to where you copied the SAS/C installation.

 assign sc: sys:programs/sasc
 assign lib: sc:lib
 assign include: sc:include
 assign cxxinclude: sc:cxxinclude
 path sc:c add

